# Architectural Audit: Decoupling API Agent into Plain MCP Tools

## 1. Current Architecture (What We Have)

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  MCP Client (Copilot/IDE)                               │
│  Sends: NL question + headers                           │
└───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────┘
                │ streamable-http (port 3000)
                ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  FastMCP Server + DynamicToolNamingMiddleware            │
│  Tools: _query, _execute                                │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │  OpenAI Agents SDK (gpt-5.2)                       │ │
│  │  Internal tools:                                    │ │
│  │   • graphql_query / rest_call  (API execution)     │ │
│  │   • sql_query                  (DuckDB post-proc)  │ │
│  │   • search_schema              (regex on schema)   │ │
│  │   • poll_until_done            (REST polling)      │ │
│  │   • recipe tools               (cached pipelines)  │ │
│  │  30-turn agent loop with system prompts            │ │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**The problem**: The org blocks running a streamable-http MCP server with an embedded agent (OpenAI Agents SDK making outbound LLM calls), but allows simple local MCP tools that execute Python scripts.

---

## 2. Proposed Architecture (What We Need)

**Strip the agent. Expose the agent's internal capabilities as individual MCP tools. Let the copilot (Claude, GitHub Copilot, etc.) be the orchestrator.**

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Copilot / IDE  (THE AGENT NOW)                         │
│  Has system prompt with schema context                  │
│  Orchestrates: fetch schema → build query → execute →   │
│                post-process with SQL                     │
└──┬──────┬──────┬──────┬──────┬──────┬───────────────────┘
   │      │      │      │      │      │
   ▼      ▼      ▼      ▼      ▼      ▼
┌──────┐┌──────┐┌──────┐┌──────┐┌──────┐┌──────┐
│fetch_││search││exec_ ││exec_ ││sql_  ││poll_ │
│schema││schema││graphql││rest  ││query ││until │
│      ││      ││      ││      ││      ││done  │
└──────┘└──────┘└──────┘└──────┘└──────┘└──────┘
   All plain MCP tools (stdio transport, local Python)
   No embedded LLM. No streamable-http.
```

