## 12. Risk Assessment

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| Copilot doesn't chain tools well | High — broken workflows | Write detailed tool descriptions; test with target copilot; provide `workflow_guide` resource |
| Schema too large for copilot context | Medium — truncated understanding | `fetch_schema` returns summary; `search_schema` for deep dives |
| State lost between tool calls | High — sql_query fails | Use stdio (Option A); state lives in process memory |
| Auth header management | Medium — can't reach protected APIs | Support multiple auth mechanisms (env var, config file, tool param) |
| DuckDB native dep blocked by org | Medium — no SQL post-processing | Fallback to sqlite3 or pandas |
| Multi-API confusion in sql_query | Low — wrong tables queried | Add `list_tables` tool; namespace tables by API |
